# The Header (.h) and Implementation (.cpp)

Open `MyFirstActor.h`. You'll see:

```cpp
UCLASS()
class MYPROJECT_API AMyFirstActor : public AActor
{
    GENERATED_BODY()

public:
    AMyFirstActor();

protected:
    virtual void BeginPlay() override;

public:
    virtual void Tick(float DeltaTime) override;
};
```
This declares a constructor, BeginPlay, and Tick.

